    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d218">

                <pb facs="0519" n="395" sameAs="frus:frus1881/pg395"/>

                <head>No. 214.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Evarts to Mr. Noyes</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1881-02-19"><hi rendition="#italic">February</hi> 19,
                        1881</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>If decree has issued prohibiting importation of American meats, present regret of
                    this government, and protest firmly if it seems appropriate to do so.</p>
                <closer><signed>EVARTS.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
